5
00:00:18.781 --> 00:00:26.176
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: A
document database stores text in tables with

6
00:00:26.176 --> 00:00:33.571
columns for title, content, and metadata,
using primary keys to uniquely identify each

7
00:00:33.571 --> 00:00:34.140
