16
00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:17.427
NARRATOR: Indexes provide additional access
paths for selected workloads.

17
00:01:17.427 --> 00:01:24.347
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: A term
frequency index stores each unique word

18
00:01:24.347 --> 00:01:30.735
