24
00:01:53.724 --> 00:02:00.083
NARRATOR: A precise definition makes later
examples easier to evaluate and revise.

25
00:02:00.194 --> 00:02:06.066
NARRATOR: With the foundation in place,
examine how Traditional Statistical Retrieval

26
00:02:06.066 --> 00:02:09.269
Models operates in a concrete sequence.

27
00:02:09.269 --> 00:02:16.300
NARRATOR: Topics include search interfaces,
traditional retrieval models (for example,

28
00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:24.035
