and term frequencies.

36
00:02:59.206 --> 00:03:06.425
NARRATOR: Follow every arrow in order and name
the state before and after each transition.

37
00:03:06.425 --> 00:03:12.378
NARRATOR: The trace converts an abstract
statement into an inspectable sequence.

38
00:03:12.482 --> 00:03:20.463
NARRATOR: Next, compare the choices involved
in BM25 Ranking Formula and make the decision

39
00:03:20.463 --> 00:03:21.603
criteria explicit.

40
00:03:21.603 --> 00:03:27.822
NARRATOR: Queries select, join, aggregate,
order, and transform data.

41
00:03:27.822 --> 00:03:34.385
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: BM25
assigns higher relevance scores to documents

42
00:03:34.385 --> 00:03:40.947
