beginning, reflecting stronger user intent

43
00:03:40.947 --> 00:03:41.494
alignment.

44
00:03:41.494 --> 00:03:48.155
NARRATOR: On screen, illustrate a document
snippet with highlighted query terms, showing

45
00:03:48.155 --> 00:03:53.150
