51
00:04:17.594 --> 00:04:23.446
NARRATOR: Apply Modern Neural Retrieval
Techniques to a worked situation instead of

52
00:04:23.446 --> 00:04:26.372
treating it as an isolated definition.

53
00:04:26.372 --> 00:04:33.830
NARRATOR: Supervised methods learn mappings
from examples paired with target labels, while

54
00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:37.559
