62
00:05:13.981 --> 00:05:19.106
NARRATOR: The worked case shows both how to
apply the method and how to check it.

63
00:05:19.226 --> 00:05:25.017
NARRATOR: Examine the tradeoffs in Search
Engine Evaluation Metrics, including what

64
00:05:25.017 --> 00:05:28.176
