65
00:05:28.176 --> 00:05:33.957
NARRATOR: An introduction to the theories and
techniques used to construct search engines.

66
00:05:33.957 --> 00:05:40.592
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: Precision
at K measures the proportion of relevant

67
00:05:40.592 --> 00:05:47.228
